,{"strID":"Money_100K","strName":"中产阶级","strDescription":"存款达到 100,000。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/3167020/8b4ad4c27f996c1560c91fd55f9bd71547089490.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":44.599998474121094,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"Endowmment_Porter","strName":"搬运者","strDescription":"解锁搬运者天赋。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/3167020/8b4ad4c27f996c1560c91fd55f9bd71547089490.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":41.29999923706055,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"Endowmment_Berserker","strName":"狂战士","strDescription":"解锁狂战士天赋。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/3167020/8b4ad4c27f996c1560c91fd55f9bd71547089490.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":41.20000076293945,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"Endowmment_Surviver","strName":"生存者","strDescription":"解锁生存者天赋。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/3167020/8b4ad4c27f996c1560c91fd55f9bd71547089490.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":39,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"Building_MiningMachine","strName":"被动收入","strDescription":"用机器赚钱。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/3167020/8b4ad4c27f996c1560c91fd55f9bd71547089490.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":38,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"Perk_Storage_t_VIP","strName":"大仓库","strDescription":"解锁仓库的VIP扩容。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/3167020/8b4ad4c27f996c1560c91fd55f9bd71547089490.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":37.400001525878906,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":55,"nAchieved":0}}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Team Soda","strURL":null}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"bilibili","strURL":null}],"rgFranchises":[]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[p]在奇异的梦境中醒来后，你发现自己身处于鸭科夫的世界中。[/p][p]一旦离开基地，各种敌人藏匿在不同的地点。在看似平静但危机四伏的鸭鸭世界中，你需要小心谨慎的前进，探索搜集各种物资。[/p][p]从初始属性平平无奇，开局只有一把枪的打工鸭开始，收集各种各样奇妙的物品，打造藏身处，强化装备，努力在鸭科夫的世界生存下去——直到安全撤离。[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/6ec3a0080c077df54f013df597f8216f.poster.avif?t=1764328964\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/6ec3a0080c077df54f013df597f8216f.webm?t=1764328964\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"][/imgvid][/p][h2]偌大地图，随机探索[/h2][p]五张地图：随机刷新的物资、神出鬼没的敌人、变化多端的天气…每次探索都像“开盲盒“，每次都有新体验。[/p][p]但务必记得及时撤离，不然可能会两手空空……[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/8d2071613195c8d77f719e9b556899d7.poster.avif?t=1764328964\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/8d2071613195c8d77f719e9b556899d7.webm?t=1764328964\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"][/imgvid][/p][h2]搜刮物资，赚钱养家[/h2][p]深入地图仔细找找，药品、装备、收藏品…你总能发现值钱的玩意儿！找到他们，带回来，卖出去，赚点钱，建设你的基地，变得更强吧！[/p][p]乍一看都是废物？善用工作台，总能变废为宝！[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/6c2c88de1a24db843b8076f7f0444ef0.poster.avif?t=1764328964\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/6c2c88de1a24db843b8076f7f0444ef0.webm?t=1764328964\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"][/imgvid][/p][h2]武器改装，随心而战[/h2][p]超过50种武器让您随心选择：上到极品高阶枪械，下到路边一根木棍，能近战硬刚，也能远处架狙；能中门对枪，也能阴暗埋伏；更有枪械改装系统让您打造专属好枪。[/p][p]用你喜欢的方式，嘎嘎乱杀！[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/87dd9f05005914826102882739152304.poster.avif?t=1764328964\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/87dd9f05005914826102882739152304.webm?t=1764328964\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"][/imgvid][/p][h2]装备升级，变大变强[/h2][p]开局两手空空？没关系，收集地图中掉落的各种蓝图，制作更强大的武器装备。游戏里更提供多种技能树升级，枪手属性、近战属性、自身属性……全方位见证你的成长。[/p][p]每一天的你，都比前一天更强！[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/6d7943a6a2aedab640ec0db6c89084c3.poster.avif?t=1764328964\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/6d7943a6a2aedab640ec0db6c89084c3.webm?t=1764328964\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"][/imgvid][/p][h2]完成任务，探寻真相[/h2][p]50h+一周目内容量，在和不同的NPC对话，完成任务的进程中，一步步搜集线索，拼凑起来，揭开鸭科夫世界的真相。生存还是毁灭？也许我们能找到第三种答案。[/p][p]无论如何，切记小心为上，祝你好运！[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/da8cca86303450161c6bc95f74b880a7.poster.avif?t=1764328964\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/da8cca86303450161c6bc95f74b880a7.webm?t=1764328964\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"][/imgvid][/p][h2]MOD和创意工坊[/h2][p]利用 Steam 创意工坊，你可以体验各种各样的鸭科夫世界。加入新武器、定制新地图、设计新任务、更多更新…巧妙利用各种模组，不断给鸭鸭世界注入新活力吧！[/p][p][/p][p]鸭科夫提供的还不止于此！[/p][p]深入游戏里，甚至还能发现更多小彩蛋哦！[/p][p]（全剧透完不就没意思了！）[/p][p]总之，探索鸭鸭乐园的最后一片乐土，找到鸭科夫的真相吧！[/p]","strSnippet":"《逃离鸭科夫》是一款鸭子题材PVE俯视角撤离射击游戏。你要在鸭科夫的世界里搜寻物资，建造藏身处，升级装备，从一无所有到做大做强；面对虎视眈眈的敌鸭，想方设法生存下去——或者逃离。"}}],["badge",{"version":1,"data":{"dtNextRetry":null,"strName":"","strIconURL":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/items/3167020/","nLevel":0,"nMaxLevel":5,"nXP":0,"bMaxed":null,"strNextLevelName":"铜鸭鸭","nNextLevelXP":100,"rgCards":[{"strName":"Lordon","strTitle":"Lordon","strImgURL":"https://community.akamai.steamstatic.com/economy/image/IzMF03bk9WpSBq-S-ekoE33L-iLqGFHVaU25ZzQNQcXdA3g5gMEPvUZZEfSMJ6dESN8p_2SVTY7V2NoOwnQMmj4QPivs0XEwSep-PMTIhgz2oOWIQS2jaW7AfHTcHQowS-cMMG_br2Dx4rvHFm7IQuF4FwhQe6YM8TZLb5iXf0xqwtVUuWG9hXt0Excvd5hFIVjonixHM78gmnZGccgHynKkJ5fb0w03aUJsDuzhA7jGb9f3xXx3Q1o5SLZcaYl-rzV9x